        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-201, Rustic Branch Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nModern Ranch decor is very in right now. It seems like it is everywhere--and for good reason. There is something so chic and beautiful about bringing updated rustic elements into a space. It seems to add the perfect finishing touch to any space. This fabulous Branch Cabinet Door Knob made by RK International would go great as a natural element to white kitchen cabinets with a pop color on the inside or as a drawer pull on an antique dresser to play up the color of the natural wood. The CK-201 Rustic Branch Cabinet Knob is available in 6 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/branch-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-401\"><b>CP-401 Branch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-201 Twig Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
